{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42321","headline":"文彧少卿文山郎中交好深至二纪已余暌别数年二子长逝奉使岭表途次南康吊孙氏之孤於其家覩文彧手书於僧室慷慨悲叹留题此诗 · 徐铉","name":"文彧少卿文山郎中交好深至二纪已余暌别数年二子长逝奉使岭表途次南康吊孙氏之孤於其家覩文彧手书於僧室慷慨悲叹留题此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孙家虚坐吊诸孤，张叟僧房见手书。\n二纪欢游今若此，满衣零泪欲何如。\n腰间金印从如斗，镜里霜华已满梳。\n珍重远公应笑我，尘心唯此未能除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}